flowchart LR
    Browser[Browser\nNext.js chat UI] --> Client[Typed sendChat client\nuseChatState]
    Client --> Proxy[Same-origin\n/api/v1/chat proxy]
    Proxy -->|BACKEND_ORIGIN| API[FastAPI\n/api/v1/chat]
    API --> Boundary[X-Request-ID\nCORS + Pydantic validation]
    Boundary --> Flow[OmniCareSupportFlow]
    Flow --> Gate[DeterministicSafetyGate]
    Gate -->|allowed| Crew[One bounded CrewAI\nsequential support agent]
    Gate -->|blocked| Safe[Safe refusal]
    Crew --> Provider[DeepSeekProvider\n30s timeout + retries]
    Crew --> Guard[Tool allowlist\nargument validator]
    Guard --> Policy[search_policy\nPolicyRetriever]
    Policy --> RAG[Markdown loader\nlocal Chroma + citations]
    RAG --> PolicyData[(data/sample_policy.md)]
    Guard --> Status[get_claim_status\nread-only repository]
    Status --> ClaimsData[(data/mock_claims.json)]
    Guard --> Submit[submit_claim\natomic persistence]
    Submit --> ClaimsData
    Crew --> Draft[AssistantDraft\nparse + grounding validator]
    Flow --> Sanitize[Trusted summary sanitizer\nChatResponse shaping]
    Safe --> Sanitize
    Draft --> Sanitize
    Sanitize --> Proxy
    Proxy --> Client
